Audio I/O (capture + playback)
============================================================

This product includes software developed by the PortAudio contributors
(PortAudio Portable Real-Time Audio Library).
  - Source:   https://github.com/PortAudio/portaudio
  - Version:  master @ 8b6333ff8744b22afaa694bc4b8b22f6f0dba6dd
